## What You Need to Add to Your Briefing JSON

Each section needs a `story_id` for tracking:

```json
{
  "sections": [
    {
      "header": "Aerospace Demand",
      "headline": "Boeing confirms 787 production increase...",
      "story_id": "boeing-787-ramp-2024",  // <-- ADD THIS
      "insights": [...]
    }
  ]
}
```

Generate stable IDs by hashing the headline or assigning during your news clustering step.

