## Summary

1. Add `story_tracker.py` and `delivery_engine.py` to your project
2. Modify your dialogue-building function to use them (see `build_podcast_dialogue`)
3. Ensure briefing JSON has `story_id` on each section
4. Switch API call from `/v1/text-to-speech` to `/v1/text-to-dialogue`

That's it. Week 1 the Hexcel story gets "Here's something new." Week 3 it gets "[light chuckle] And here it is again."